<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 2.0 points off FTSE 100.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 2.0 points off FTSE 100.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on April 28 and analysts estimate this will take 2.00 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>					    DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					     (PENCE)	EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY		 Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>	 *Guardian Royal Exch	6.6    8.25     0.437</p>
<p>	 *Hays Plc		     3.0    3.75     0.09</p>
<p>	 *Legal &amp; General	    7.63   9.53     0.687</p>
<p>	 *Smithkline Beecham	 +4.41   4.9	0.784</p>
<p>+ First interim dividend payment includes foreign income dividend of 2.45p</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
